                                                "sense_id": "14acba2d-47f9-34a4-a53a-1be8318277b0",
                                                "text": "This may sound strange to readers who know little about nudes but many female impersonators, or femme-mimics, work au naturel—except for a gaff, a bra, body makeup, jewelry, and a wig (on their head). See! Semi-nude!!"
                                            },
