                                                "example_id": "546c3085-29dc-4f3b-86f9-a9106b805a65",
                                                "sense_id": "14acba2d-47f9-34a4-a53a-1be8318277b0",
                                                "text": "Vicky is a pre-operative MTF transsexual […] Wearing feminine underwear over her gaff in bed helps her to redefine her absence of female genitalia during sex (sexuality) in terms of it being her 'time of the month', as she jokes to Sean [her first boyfriend]."
                                            }
